{% comment %}
Data source: settings.yml strategy `polling`, polling_url GET
https://Tanzeel159.github.io/design-drill-deck/daily.json
The JSON is already Liquid-shaped, so a serverless transform is optional
(see src/transform.js). Top-level keys used here:
  prompts, daily_picks, difficulty_levels, display_date, rotation_date,
  default_difficulty, default_rotation_mode
{% endcomment %}
{% assign prompt_total = prompts | size %}
{% comment %}
feed_empty is the markup flag for a missing/failed deck. Do not assign
p = prompts | first when the bank is empty: that can leave p as a non-blank
empty object, so the views skip their empty state and render a blank screen.
{% endcomment %}
{% assign feed_empty = false %}
{% if prompt_total == 0 %}{% assign feed_empty = true %}{% endif %}
{% assign settings_values = trmnl.plugin_settings.custom_fields_values %}
{% comment %}
TRMNL stores select values lowercase (e.g. core_ux_flow). daily.json keys
use the same lowercase slugs, so downcase keeps lookups aligned if a value
arrives mixed-case.
{% endcomment %}
{% assign focus_area = settings_values.focus_area | default: "all" | strip | downcase %}
{% if focus_area == "all_categories" %}{% assign focus_area = "all" %}{% endif %}
{% assign difficulty = settings_values.difficulty | default: default_difficulty | default: "intermediate" | strip | downcase %}
{% assign rotation_mode = settings_values.rotation_mode | default: default_rotation_mode | default: "smart_shuffle" | strip | downcase %}
{% assign level_matches = difficulty_levels | where: "key", difficulty %}
{% assign level_profile = level_matches | first %}
{% assign pattern_limit = level_profile.pattern_limit | default: 4 %}
{% assign picks_for_mode = daily_picks[rotation_mode] %}
{% assign picks_for_focus = picks_for_mode[focus_area] %}
{% assign pick = picks_for_focus[difficulty] %}
{% if pick == blank and picks_for_focus.prompt_id != blank %}
  {% assign pick = picks_for_focus %}
{% endif %}
{% comment %}
Pick priority when the requested path is missing or malformed:
  1. daily_picks[rotation_mode][focus_area][difficulty]
  2. that focus node itself, if it already has prompt_id (legacy shape)
  3. daily_picks.smart_shuffle.all.intermediate
  4. daily_picks.smart_shuffle.all (legacy unscoped node)
  5. day-of-year modulo over prompts (last resort if the feed is empty)
{% endcomment %}
{% if pick == blank %}
  {% assign pick = daily_picks.smart_shuffle.all.intermediate | default: daily_picks.smart_shuffle.all %}
{% endif %}
{% if pick != blank %}
  {% assign matches = prompts | where: "id", pick.prompt_id %}
  {% assign p = matches | first %}
  {% assign drill_number = pick.drill_number | default: pick.position %}
  {% assign total = pick.pool_size %}
{% else %}
  {% comment %}
  This branch only runs if daily.json is malformed or empty: no pick for the
  requested mode/focus/difficulty, and the smart_shuffle.all fallbacks above
  also failed. Day-of-year modulo over prompts keeps the screen from going blank
  when the bank is present; if prompt_total is 0 the views show the empty state.
  {% endcomment %}
  {% if prompt_total > 0 %}
    {% assign day = "now" | date: "%j" | plus: 0 %}
    {% assign legacy_idx = day | modulo: prompt_total %}
    {% assign p = prompts[legacy_idx] %}
    {% assign drill_number = legacy_idx | plus: 1 %}
    {% assign total = prompt_total %}
  {% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% if p == blank and prompt_total > 0 %}
  {% assign p = prompts | first %}
{% endif %}
{% assign display_date = display_date | default: rotation_date | default: "now" %}
{% comment %}
p.mode is the category label on every prompt in daily.json (generator-required).
If a prompt omits it, use the selected focus_area scope label, then the slug.
{% endcomment %}
{% assign scope_matches = scopes | where: "key", focus_area %}
{% assign scope_profile = scope_matches | first %}
{% assign card_mode = p.mode | default: scope_profile.label | default: focus_area %}
